* If you did not get the Survival Guide on the ride in, exit the Safehold at (I-5), the Survival Guide is right outside.

=2 Walkthrough
\**NOTE**: {n:Elysia} at (G-10) on the main floor of the safehold begins the quest {q:Unforgiven|Unforgiven|Unforgiven}. The reward is a map of {z:Tavnazian Safehold} which can be very useful as you will be spending a lot of time here.
* When the cutscene ends, make your way to the **Walnut Door at **(K-9) on the top floor of the safehold (south side).
** Make sure you go to the Walnut Door at (K-9). There's another Walnut Door at (K-7) that will not work.
* Enter the room and speak to {n:Despachiaire} at (K-10) for a cutscene.
** **(Optional)** On the same floor, talk to Justinius at (J-6), as he will warn you not to go to the Sewer Entrance.
* After the cutscene, head back to the main room by going down the stairs. Go down one more flight of stairs all the way to the lowest level of the safehold and check the Sewer Entrance at (I-7).

=2 Optional
* {n:Ombelotte} (H-7) on the main floor of Tavnazian Safehold near the exits is one of the (*) {n:Quest Guide NPCs}; she can place map markers for NPCs in Tavnazia that have quests appropriate for your level and {q:fame|Fame|fame}.
* {q:Chasing Dreams|Chasing Dreams|Chasing Dreams} is now available in {z:Rabao}. (Suitable for Level 30+)
* {q:Unforgiven|Unforgiven|Unforgiven} is available upon entering Tavnazian Safehold. (Suitable for any level)
* {q:A Bitter Past|A Bitter Past|A Bitter Past} is available upon entering Tavnazian Safehold. (Suitable for Level 40+)
* Lockpicking ({p:Thief}-only): A Thief who wants to be able to open doors on the next mission without keys can use a few different tools.
** {@i:Skeleton Key|1115} {i:Skeleton Key|Skeleton Key|1115}: A {@i:Key Ring Belt|15880} {p:Key Ring Belt} can be obtained from the quest {q:Bait and Switch|Bait and Switch|Bait and Switch} in the {z:Metalworks} (repeatable after {p:Conquest Tally}).
** {@i:Thief's Tools|1022} {i:Thief's Tools|Thief's Tools|1022}: Purchasable from vendors if your nation is 3rd place in the {p:Conquest}.
